     * Extends the sign of a JPEG Huffman decoded value.
     *
     * <p>The original implementation used a {@code while} loop that recomputed {@code vt}
     * on each iteration, which could never terminate for crafted inputs and caused a
     * potential denial‑of‑service. The JPEG specification requires a single conditional
     * adjustment – not a loop – so the method is rewritten to perform a single check
     * after validating its parameters.</p>
